    LoginUI --> AuthService
    AuthService -->|POST /api/auth/login<br/>X-WW-CSRF: 1| AuthRoutes
    AuthService -->|POST /api/auth/register| AuthRoutes
    AuthService -->|POST /api/auth/logout| AuthRoutes
    
    AuthRoutes --> AuthMiddleware
    AuthMiddleware -->|Valid| AuthDB
    AuthMiddleware -->|Invalid| AuthError[401/403 Error]
    
    AuthDB -->|Production| PostgreSQL
    AuthDB -->|Dev Mode| LocalJSON
    
    SaveSystem --> LocalSave[(Local Save File)]
    SaveSystem -->|On Save| CloudSaveMgr
    
    CloudSaveMgr -->|Configure NOT called| NoConfig[Cloud Sync Skipped]
    CloudSaveMgr -->|If Configured| PersistenceRoutes
    
    PersistenceRoutes --> FirebaseAdmin
    FirebaseAdmin -->|ID Token Valid| Firestore
    FirebaseAdmin -->|No Credentials| FirebaseError[503 Not Ready]
    
    RealtimeMgr -->|Placeholder - No Socket.IO Client| NoMultiplayer[Multiplayer Not Connected]
    
    SocketIO --> RoomMgr
    SocketIO --> PlayerMgr
    RoomMgr -->|Room Full| RoomFull[Reject Connection]
    PlayerMgr -->|Movement Update| Broadcast[Broadcast to Room]
    
    Express -->|Health| HealthEP[/health]
    Express -->|Readiness| ReadyEP[/ready]
    ReadyEP --> AuthDB
    ReadyEP --> FirebaseAdmin
    
