**Legend:**
- 🟢 Green = Working and verified
- 🟡 Yellow = Code exists but not fully integrated
- 🔴 Red = Missing implementation

**Key Issues:**
1. CloudSaveManager.Configure() is never called, so cloud sync always falls back to local saves
2. RealtimeManager has no Socket.IO client — multiplayer cannot connect
3. Firebase requires credentials (service account JSON) for cloud saves
